docs {
  Uses client Bearer JWT at gateway.
  - List mode: omit `user_id` and use filters/pagination.
  - Lookup mode: send `user_id` only (single object response).
  Mixing `user_id` with list params returns `400 INVALID_PARAM`.
  
}

